       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MAIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 N PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "SUB" USING N.
           DISPLAY "N=" N " RC=" RETURN-CODE.
           STOP RUN.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUB.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 X PIC 9(3).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING X.
           ADD 10 TO X.
           MOVE 42 TO RETURN-CODE.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM SUB.
       END PROGRAM MAIN.
